flowchart TD
  A["发起加急或点击确认"] --> B["im.posts.urgentPost / im.posts.urgentConfirm"]
  B --> C["Venus/C++ JSON stringify 或 host observation"]
  C --> D["`im_urgent_post` / `im_urgent_confirm`"]
  D --> E["Helix V1 Tick/Effect 路径"]
  E --> F["`POST /api/cses/posts/urgentPost` body `{channelId,postId,targetIds,message?}`；`POST /api/cses/posts/urgentConfirm` body `{postId,channelId}`"]
  F --> G["`post_update`, `update_channel`"]
  G --> H["批量 raw DomainEvent 回调 C++"]
  H --> I["Venus owning-thread tick / MobileImSdk legacy reducer"]
  I --> J["JS/C++ 重建：加急标识、确认人数、目标列表与按钮权限一致，actor/observer 视图按权限分离"]
  E -. "Persist/HTTP/WS 失败" .-> X["raw failure event 或 SOURCE_MISSING"]
  X --> I
